$()	   Le triangle 
!insmath $val7$val8$val9
$() est rectangle en 
!insmath $val8
$(). On a donc selon <strong>$val34</strong> :	<div class="wimscenter">
!insmath $val7$val9^2 = $val7$val8^2 + $val8$val9^2
$()</div>	<p>On sait que 
!insmath $val7$val8 = $val22
$() et que 
!insmath $val8$val9 = $val24
$().</p>	   On a donc :	<div class="wimscenter"> 
!insmath $val25^2 = $val22^2 + $val24^2 = $val29
$()</div>	<div class="wimscenter"> 
!insmath $val25 = \sqrt{$val29} = $val28
$()</div>	
$()
